{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take your first flight into the world of AEROMACHINA in this free-to-play virtual mission!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>AEROMACHINA: Test-Flight</i> is a first look at the upcoming\u00a03D Platformer Metroidvania <i> AEROMACHINA</i>!<i> </i>Play as Bogey inside the Virtual Machina Environment: an antiquated training simulator designed to refine his aerobatic and combat skills \u2013 but is it really as safe as everyone thinks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For more frenetic 2X2X dogfighting, be sure to wishlist the full game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snappy platformer and hack-and-slash gameplay that evolves with the discovery of new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A non-linear Metroidvania dungeon to explore. New abilities offer new paths to explore, but ace players will find their own way without them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover secret encounters, hidden upgrades, and humorous characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rose-tinted low-poly graphics that modernize and expand upon an iconic art style.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744860?t=1749443814","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744860?t=1749443814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744860/11278e0954eb103adb76c516d5f0f2fcee18ff40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749443814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744860/11278e0954eb103adb76c516d5f0f2fcee18ff40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749443814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id